<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX EDGES UP, ENDS AT 1,419.33 POINTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX EDGES UP, ENDS AT 1,419.33 POINTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index edged up 9.35 points or 0.66 percent to 1,419.33 points on Wednesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
</text>
